{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":80487,\"title\":\"Ninjas and Dragons\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Japanese martial arts sensation Junya Takagi (student of the great Sonny Chiba), stars as a young Bushido Master who travels to China in search of clues to his father's murder. He discovers that the Ninjas were responsible for his death and now they have teamed up with the vagabonds and Mongols, and are planning a coup of the Chinese government. The young Busliido fighter forms an alliance with some top Kung Fu men to stop the coup and get revenge for his father in this rare Chinese/Japanese co-production.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hLQWO9tVloXEvxSpmfL4Z2HLSPg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":1984,\"runtime\":84,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Action\",\"Mystery\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CN\",\"name\":\"China\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Ding Cheuk-Lun\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":589571,\"name\":\"Ding Cheuk-Lun\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":589572,\"name\":\"Takagi Junya\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q6XbLQnO0EckVdSHXqib8uqvyUo.jpg\"},{\"id\":589573,\"name\":\"Dong Li\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":589574,\"name\":\"Ha Ching\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1820531,\"name\":\"Chu Ahlin\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1820532,\"name\":\"Sun Kenfa\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1820533,\"name\":\"Xu Li\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1168190,\"title\":\"The Wrecking Crew\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gbVwHl4YPSq6BcC92TQpe7qUTh6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cz4vLJrmaV1zJlRYbxqtvLzeLWB.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Estranged half-brothers Jonny and James reunite after their father's mysterious death. As they search for the truth, buried secrets reveal a conspiracy threatening to tear their family apart.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":638974,\"title\":\"Murder Mystery 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s1VzVhXlqsevi8zeCMG9A16nEUf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AwB7HGeDTrBGkP2WEnNwg8Wa0E4.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After starting their own detective agency, Nick and Audrey Spitz land a career-making case when their billionaire pal is kidnapped from his wedding.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Mystery\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":7364,\"title\":\"Sahara\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kyY1onYxkKBDlJsheRsVbMaoQEM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/CXQ9wYj4n9MBwy2TQ92YaRygWj.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Seasoned adventurer and treasure hunter Dirk Pitt, a former Navy SEAL, sets out for the African desert with his wisecracking buddy Al in search of a confederate ironclad battleship rumored to have vanished long ago, the main draw being the treasure supposedly hidden within the lost vessel. When the daring duo come across Dr. Eva Rojas, a beautiful scientist who is juggling an escape from a warlord and a mission to stop the spread of a powerful plague, their desert expedition begins to heat up.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":389053,\"title\":\"The Do-Over\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z9VCm2E6gCAwbM2SELRawfqdXBO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rDZArKpxVhrLXrRYD9xF271klVf.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The life of a bank manager is turned upside down when a friend from his past manipulates him into faking his own death and taking off on an adventure.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":383785,\"title\":\"Kung Fu Yoga\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rL6XM4fsr1cM5mN2flEhQ8jQter.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/meS8C4fE5RbhZBf754WdQ8MiT9f.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two professors team up to locate a lost treasure and embark on an adventure that takes them from a Tibetan ice cave to Dubai, and to a mountain temple in India.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Mystery\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":486131,\"title\":\"Shaft\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kfZqwGuvEBAysAbCsa0QLKoSYR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hwaYxb8nm7ADQRgUIsqUTsDwgyO.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"JJ, aka John Shaft Jr., may be a cyber security expert with a degree from MIT, but to uncover the truth behind his best friend’s untimely death, he needs an education only his dad can provide. Absent throughout JJ’s youth, the legendary locked-and-loaded John Shaft agrees to help his progeny navigate Harlem’s heroin-infested underbelly.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":345915,\"title\":\"Once Upon a Time in Venice\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5rr7tQfzS0ARqEea3W9SNSFGRzb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wJQowXYcpcujDJA2NAM1GSCZtM2.jpg\",\"rating\":5.2,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Steve Ford is a private detective in Venice Beach, Calif., who's good with the ladies, bad with the punches and wild about his dog Buddy. When local thugs steal Buddy, Ford turns to Spyder, their devious leader, and forges an unlikely alliance. With help from his best friend, Steve pulls out the big guns to retrieve Spyder's stolen cash and cocaine and save Buddy.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10762,\"title\":\"Without a Paddle\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bSQBfHDzyfzxrCLepjegVb5F8j8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vEEEKiUJOXmOJXW7X8P3kCgsm9p.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Three friends, whose lives have been drifting apart, reunite for the funeral of a fourth childhood friend. When looking through their childhood belongings, they discover a trunk which contained details on a quest their friend was attempting. It revealed that he was hot on the trail of the $200,000 that went missing with airplane hijacker D.B. Cooper in 1971. They decide to continue his journey, but do not understand the dangers they will soon encounter.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1357305,\"title\":\"Detective Chinatown 1900\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g3GsgIlH3fA4RxhNOAMvSbVWyfW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4xN3phAX024b251CPhy8zvsXbBc.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1900, the mysterious murder of a white woman and a Native American man in San Francisco's Chinatown triggers a race against time as the Chinese suspect and the Native American's adopted Chinese son work to uncover the truth while a politician seeks to leverage the Chinese Exclusion Bill as well as the prevailing xenophobia and racism to close down Chinatown and elect himself as the mayor.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Mystery\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":385332,\"title\":\"Terminal\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xi7pA3lL6Wb78p6Y6PgWoHDMjrM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8K5S5W0te4FJ0GVRHcPYPETWwLA.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the dark heart of a sprawling, anonymous city, two assassins carry out a sinister mission, a teacher battles a fatal illness, and an enigmatic janitor and a curious waitress lead dangerous double lives.  Murderous consequences unravel in the dead of night, as their lives intertwine at the hands of a mysterious criminal mastermind who is hell-bent on revenge.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5175,\"title\":\"Rush Hour 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aBQf2vMiCINeVC9v6BGVYKXurTh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vPJwn9pp5f58CqdaXU3eOSLoJkl.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"It's vacation time for Carter as he finds himself alongside Lee in Hong Kong wishing for more excitement. While Carter wants to party and meet the ladies, Lee is out to track down a Triad gang lord who may be responsible for killing two men at the American Embassy. Things get complicated as the pair stumble onto a counterfeiting plot. The boys are soon up to their necks in fist fights and life-threatening situations. A trip back to the U.S. may provide the answers about the bombing, the counterfeiting, and the true allegiance of sexy customs agent Isabella.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":647785,\"title\":\"Debt Collectors\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A8FWpw3WHUo9EvU1xMWZRjdRlN3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vXUX7Qi4rtOh2TxqA1eB2CU6QAo.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A pair of debt collectors are thrust into an explosively dangerous situation, chasing down various lowlifes while also evading a vengeful kingpin.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"QjIois0jvy0\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"8E4DdZQAUus\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"9N9AWU5AQ-4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}